#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Useto Ngokubanzi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service Check Name"
msgstr "Igama loHlolo lweNkonzo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The name that is displayed for this Service Check, and is included in any Alert notifications."
msgstr "Igama eliboniswayo kolu Vavanyo lweNkonzo, kwaye eliqukiweyo kuzo naziphi na izaziso zeZilumkiso."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many attempts"
msgstr "Zingaphi iinzame"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti attempts to run each test multiple times. The first successful attempt ends the testing and records the success. If none of the attempts are successful, the test is terminated and a failure is recorded. High number causes log test duration."
msgstr "I-Cacti izama ukusebenzisa uvavanyo ngalunye amaxesha amaninzi. Umzamo wokuqala ophumeleleyo uyaluphelisa uvavanyo kwaye urekhode impumelelo. Ukuba akukho namnye kwimizamo ophumelelayo, uvavanyo luyapheliswa kwaye kurekhodwe ukusilela. Inani eliphezulu libangela ubude bexesha lovavanyo lwelogi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable test"
msgstr "Vula uvavanyo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disable this test from being checked."
msgstr "Susa uphawu kule bhokisi ukucima olu vavanyo ekujongweni."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable run script for this test"
msgstr "Vula isikripthi sokusebenza kolu vavanyo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the global Command Execution function is enabled, you can set here whether the script should be run for this test or not."
msgstr "Ukuba umsebenzi jikelele wokuQhuba uMyalelo uvuliwe, unokuseta apha ukuba iskripthi kufuneka siqhutywe kolu vavanyo okanye hayi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "I-Poller"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller on which the test will run"
msgstr "I-Poller apho uvavanyo luya kuqhutyelwa khona"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Type of service"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwenkonzo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "What type of service?"
msgstr "Loluphi uhlobo lwenkonzo?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "IP Address or DNS name of server"
msgstr "IDilesi ye-IP okanye igama le-DNS leseva"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You can specify another port (example.com:5000) otherwise default will be used. For IPv6 numeric address use [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use here name of server (example 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"
msgstr "Ungachaza elinye izibuko (example.com:5000) kungenjalo kuza kusetyenziswa elingagqibekanga. Kwidilesi yenani ye-IPv6 sebenzisa i-[ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. Kwi-DOH (DNS over HTTPS) sebenzisa apha igama leseva (umzekelo 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Resolve DNS to Address"
msgstr "Sombulula i-DNS ibe yiDilesi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an IP Address to force DNS name to resolve to. Leaving blank will use DNS Resolution instead."
msgstr "Faka iDilesi ye-IP ukuze unyanzelise igama le-DNS lisonjululwe kuyo. Ukushiya kungenanto kuya kusebenzisa uSombululo lwe-DNS endaweni yoko."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "Iisetingi zenkonzo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Select correct credential"
msgstr "Khetha isiqinisekiso esichanekileyo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP OID"
msgstr "I-OID ye-SNMP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SNMP OID"
msgstr "Faka i-SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH command"
msgstr "Umyalelo we-SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SSH command with full path, result of command will be returned"
msgstr "Faka umyalelo we-SSH onendlela epheleleyo, isiphumo somyalelo siza kubuyiswa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your own CA and intermediate certs"
msgstr "Izatifikethi zakho ze-CA kunye nezaphakathi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP Search"
msgstr "Ukukhangela kwe-LDAP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search filter, it could be ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"
msgstr "Isihluzi sokukhangela se-LDAP, sinokuba ngu-,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS Name for Query"
msgstr "Igama le-DNS loMbuzo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS name for querying. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use /resolve?name=example.com or /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. For plaintext DNS A and AAAA records will be returned"
msgstr "Igama le-DNS lokubuza. Kwi-DOH (i-DNS nge-HTTPS) sebenzisa /resolve?name=example.com okanye /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. Kwi-DNS yesiqhelo ebhaliweyo, iirekhodi ze-A neze-AAAA ziya kubuyiswa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Path Part of URL"
msgstr "Inxalenye yeNdlela ye-URL"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For web service insert at least \"/\" or something like \"/any/path/\"."
msgstr "Kwinkonzo yewebhu faka ubuncinane \"/\" okanye into enjenge \"/nayiphi/indlela/\"."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Ifuna Uqinisekiso"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Phawula le bhokisi ukuba isiza sihlala sibuyisa iPhutha le-401 njengoko sifuna igama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Iseva ye-Proxy"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Ukuba lo mbhalo woqhagamshelwano ufuna i-proxy, yikhethe apha. Kungenjalo khetha 'Akukho'."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Jonga iSiqinisekiso"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Ukuba usebenzisa i-SSL, khetha le bhokisi ukuba ufuna ukuqinisekisa isatifikethi. Ngokungagqibekanga ivuliwe, cima ukuba isiza sisebenzisa isatifikethi esizisayinelweyo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check and notify Certificate expiration"
msgstr "Jonga kwaye wazise ngokuphelelwa kwesiqinisekiso"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to check the certificate expiration. You can set in settings how many days before expiration notify.."
msgstr "Ukuba usebenzisa i-SSL, khetha le bhokisi ukuba ufuna ukujonga ukuphelelwa kwesatifikethi. Unokuseta kwiisetingi ukuba zingaphi iintsuku ngaphambi kokuphelelwa ukwazisa.."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Iiparamitha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How Often to Test"
msgstr "Kuvavanywa Kangaphi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Test every xth poller run"
msgstr "Vavanya kwintsebenzo ye-Poller yesi-x nganye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Isivuseleli"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the service must be DOWN before an alert email is triggered."
msgstr "Kukangaphi apho inkonzo kufuneka ibe PHANTSI phambi kokuba kuqaliswe i-imeyile yesilumkiso."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Long duration alert"
msgstr "Isilumkiso sexesha elide"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the test time is greater than this value more times in a row, send a notification. Related to variable Duration count. The test inherits the maximum runtime from the settings. If a higher value is set here, the maximum runtime is this value + 2 seconds."
msgstr "Ukuba ixesha lovavanyo likhulu kuneli xabiso ngamaxesha amaninzi alandelelanayo, thumela isaziso. Kuyamkelana ne-variable ye-Duration count. Uvavanyo luthatha elona xesha lide lokusebenza kwiisetingi. Ukuba ixabiso eliphezulu licwangcisiwe apha, elona xabiso lide lokusebenza leli xabiso + imizuzwana emi-2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Number of duration violations in a row"
msgstr "Inani lokwaphulwa kwexesha elilandelelanayo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the duration trigger must be exceeded in a row for a notification to be sent"
msgstr "Kukangaphi apho umqondiso wexesha kufuneka ugqithiswe ngokulandelelana ukuze kuthunyelwe isaziso"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verification Strings"
msgstr "Imitya yoQinisekiso"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String"
msgstr "Umtya wokuKhangela iMpendulo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for in the response for a live and working service."
