msgstr "Ixabiso lethokheni"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "<b>Can be used for a lot of service checks:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - optional, when it is set, try HTTP basic auth<br/><i>SMTP on port 587</i> - optional. Without a username/password, only the server response is tested. With a username and password, login is also performed<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - optional. For anonymous ftp, use username \"anonymous\" and email address as password<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - required<br/><i>MQTT</i> - optional<br/><i>SCP, SSH command</i> - you can use this method or private key method"
msgstr "<b>Ingasetyenziselwa iitshekhi zeenkonzo ezininzi:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - ayinyanzelekanga, xa imiselwe, zama uqinisekiso olusisiseko lwe-HTTP<br/><i>SMTP kwizibuko 587</i> - ayinyanzelekanga. Ngaphandle kwegama lomsebenzisi/iphasiwedi, kuvavanywa impendulo yeseva kuphela. Ngegama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi, ukungena nako kuyahlolwa<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - ayinyanzelekanga. Kwi-ftp engaziwayo, sebenzisa igama lomsebenzisi elithi \"anonymous\" nedilesi ye-imeyile njengephasiwedi<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - iyafuneka<br/><i>MQTT</i> - ayinyanzelekanga<br/><i>SCP, SSH command</i> - ungasebenzisa le ndlela okanye indlela yesitshixo sabucala"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Basic HTTP auth. Username and password are required"
msgstr "I-Rest API - Uqinisekiso olusisiseko lwe-HTTP. Igama lomsebenzisi kunye nephasiwedi ziyafuneka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - API key auth<br/>Auth is sent in HTTP header, custom header or POST method. Credentials in URL are not supported.<br/>Insert API key name and value. Both values are required. For HTTP header the name <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> is usually used (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). For custom header <i>X-API-Key</i> is usually used (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). For POST <i>api_key</i> is usually used."
msgstr "I-Rest API - Uqinisekiso lweqhosha le-API<br/>Uqinisekiso luthunyelwa kwi-header ye-HTTP, i-header yesiko okanye indlela ye-POST. Iinkcukacha zokungena kwi-URL azixhaswanga.<br/>Faka igama neqhosha lexabiso le-API. Omabini amaxabiso ayafuneka. Kwi-header ye-HTTP igama elithi <i>Bearer okanye apikey okanye \"\"</i> lihlala lisetyenziswa (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). Kwi-header yesiko u-<i>X-API-Key</i> uhlala esetyenziswa (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). Kwi-POST u-<i>api_key</i> uhlala esetyenziswa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - OAuth2/Bearer token auth<br/>You can have key/token from server and insert it here or use auth flow with credentials. Username and password are sent Json encoded."
msgstr "I-Rest API - Uqinisekiso lwetokheni ye-OAuth2/Bearer<br/>Ungafumana iqhosha/itokheni kweseva uze uyifake apha okanye usebenzise inkqubo yoqinisekiso ngeenkcukacha zokungena. Igama lomsebenzisi kunye nephasiwedi zithunyelwa zikhowudwe nge-Json."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Cookie based auth - both values are required. After login, cookie is returned"
msgstr "I-Rest API - Uqinisekiso olusekelwe kwi-Cookie - omabini amaxabiso ayafuneka. Emva kokungena, i-cookie iyabuyiswa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v1 or v2 - required, insert community name here"
msgstr "I-SNMP v1 okanye v2 - iyafuneka, faka igama loluntu apha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 - The security level determines which parameters are required"
msgstr "I-SNMP v3 - Inqanaba lokhuseleko limisela ukuba zeziphi iiparamitha ezifunekayo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key - Can be used for SCP or SSH command test. These test can use username/password too"
msgstr "Isitshixo sabucala se-SSH - Sinokusetyenziselwa uvavanyo lwe-SCP okanye lomyalelo we-SSH. Olu vavanyo lunokusebenzisa igama lomsebenzisi/iphasiwedi nalo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the web server is responding. If username/password credential is used, it will try Basic HTTP auth."
msgstr "Ihlola kuphela ukuba iseva yewebhu iyaphendula na. Ukuba isiqinisekiso segama lomsebenzisi/iphasiwedi siyasetyenziswa, iya kuzama ukuqinisekiswa kwe-Basic HTTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as HTTP plaintext but adds the ability to test certificates."
msgstr "Iyafana ne-HTTP plaintext kodwa yongeza isakhono sokuvavanya izatifikethi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the SMTP server is responding. No authentication. You will see server login banner and ehlo response."
msgstr "Ihlola kuphela ukuba iseva ye-SMTP iyaphendula na. Akukho kuqinisekiswa. Uya kubona ibhena yokungena yeseva kunye nempendulo ye-ehlo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted + STARTTLS. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. Without username and password, you will see server login banner and ehlo response. With credential, login will be performed"
msgstr "Ayifihlwa + STARTTLS. Kunokwenzeka kwakhona ukuvavanya ukusebenza kwesiqinisekiso. Ngaphandle kwegama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi, uya kubona ibhanela yokungena kweseva kunye nempendulo ye-ehlo. Ngeziqinisekiso, ukungena kuya kwenziwa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted connection on default port 465. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. With username and password AUTH LOGIN will be tested."
msgstr "Uqhagamshelwano olubhaliweyo ngokufihlakeleyo kwiphoti esisiseko engu-465. Kuyenzeka kwakhona ukuvavanya ukusebenza kwesatifikethi. Ngegama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi i-AUTH LOGIN iya kuvavanywa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted IMAP connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages. You can use AUTHENTICATE PLAIN or AUTHENTICATE LOGIN method."
msgstr "Uqhagamshelo lwe-IMAP olungafihlwanga. Ngaphandle kweziqinisekiso, kuza kuvavanywa uqhagamshelo kuphela. Uya kubona ibhanela yokungena kuphela. Ngeziqinisekiso ukungena kuya kuvavanywa kwaye kuzame ukufunda uluhlu lwemiyalezo. Ungasebenzisa indlela ye-AUTHENTICATE PLAIN okanye ye-AUTHENTICATE LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted IMAP but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Iyafana ne-IMAP engafihlwanga kodwa emva kokungena kusetyenziswa i-STARTTLS. Kuyenzeka kwakhona ukuvavanya ukusebenza kwesatifikethi emva kwe-STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted IMAP, you can try login and test certificate and user login"
msgstr "I-IMAP ebhaliweyo ngokufihlakeleyo, ungazama ukungena kwaye uvavanye isatifikethi kunye nokungena komsebenzisi"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted POP3 connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages"
msgstr "Uqhagamshelo lwe-POP3 olungafihlwanga. Ngaphandle kweziqinisekiso, kuza kuvavanywa uqhagamshelo kuphela. Uya kubona ibhanela yokungena kuphela. Ngeziqinisekiso ukungena kuya kuvavanywa kwaye kuzame ukufunda uluhlu lwemiyalezo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted POP3 but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Iyafana ne-POP3 engafihlwanga kodwa emva kokungena kusetyenziswa i-STARTTLS. Kuyenzeka kwakhona ukuvavanya ukusebenza kwesatifikethi emva kwe-STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted POP3, you can try login and test certificate and user login."
msgstr "I-POP3 ebhaliweyo ngokufihlakeleyo, ungazama ukungena kwaye uvavanye isatifikethi kunye nokungena komsebenzisi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to resolve DNS record on specified DNS server"
msgstr "Zama ukusombulula irekhodi ye-DNS kwiseva ye-DNS echaziweyo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try DNS over HTTPS."
msgstr "Zama i-DNS phezu kwe-HTTPS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform unencrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Zonke iiparamitha ziyafuneka. Yenza ukungena kwe-LDAP okungafihlwanga kunye nokukhangela"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform encrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Zonke iiparamitha ziyafuneka. Yenza ukungena kwe-LDAP okufihliweyo kunye nokukhangela"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted FTP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt). For anonymous connection use login *anonymous* and email address as password. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Uqhagamshelo lwe-FTP olungafihlwanga, ngena kwaye uzame ukukhuphela ifayile echazwe kwindlela (/path/to/file.txt). Kuqhagamshelo olungaziwayo sebenzisa igama lokungena *anonymous* kunye nedilesi ye-imeyile njengephasiwedi. Umxholo wefayile uyabuyiswa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt) from TFTP server. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Zama ukukhuphela ifayile echazwe kwindlela (/path/to/file.txt) kwiseva ye-TFTP. Okuqukethwe kwifayile kuyabuyiswa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted SCP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt)."
msgstr "Uqhagamshelwano lwe-SCP olubhaliweyo ngokufihlakeleyo, ngena kwaye uzame ukukhuphela ifayile echazwe kwindlela (/path/to/file.txt)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SMB protocol, username and password are required. Try to login and download file."
msgstr "Zama iprothokholi ye-SMB, igama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi ziyafuneka. Zama ukungena uze ukhuphele ifayile."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connect to MQTT server and listen for any message. You can specify topic in Path (bedroom/temp), blank for any topic. For this test is recommended increase \"Long duration alert\""
msgstr "Qhagamshela kwiseva ye-MQTT uze umamele nawuphi na umyalezo. Unokuchaza isihloko kwi-Path (bedroom/temp), okanye ushiye kungenanto nakwesiphi na isihloko. Kolu vavanyo kuyacetyiswa ukuba wandise i-\"Isilumkiso sexesha elide\""

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with basic HTTP auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Uvavanyo lwe-REST API ngogunyaziso olusisiseko lwe-HTTP. Lungisa iziqinisekiso kuqala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with API key auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Uvavanyo lwe-REST API ngogunyaziso lwesitshixo se-API. Lungisa iziqinisekiso kuqala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with Oauth2. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Uvavanyo lwe-REST API nge-Oauth2. Lungisa iziqinisekiso kuqala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with cookie auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Uvavanyo lwe-REST API ngogunyaziso lwe-cookie. Lungisa iziqinisekiso kuqala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP get method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Zama indlela ye-SNMP get. Iziphumo ze-OID echaziweyo ziyabuyiswa. Isiqinisekiso sokungena siyafuneka, kufuneka ulungise isiqinisekiso se-SNMP v.1,2 okanye v3 kuqala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP walk method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Zama indlela ye-SNMP walk. Iziphumo ze-OID echaziweyo ziyabuyiswa. Isiqinisekiso sokungena siyafuneka, kufuneka ulungise isiqinisekiso se-SNMP v.1,2 okanye v3 kuqala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use ssh and connect to remote host. After login run specified command and return output. Username and password or private key is possible."
msgstr "Sebenzisa i-ssh kwaye uqhagamshele kwihosti ekude. Emva kokungena sebenzisa umyalelo ochaziweyo uze ubuyisele iziphumo. Igama lomsebenzisi kunye nephasiwedi okanye isitshixo sabucala zinokwenzeka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SFTP protocol on port 22, username and password and path are required. Try to do directory listing of path."
msgstr "Iprothokholi ye-SFTP kwizibuko 22, igama lomsebenzisi nephasiwedi kunye nendlela ziyafuneka. Zama ukwenza uludwe lweefolda zendlela."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All fine. Proceed as usual."
msgstr "Konke kulungile. Qhubeka njengesiqhelo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL you passed to libcurl used a protocol that this libcurl does not support. The support might be a compile-time option that you did not use, it can be a misspelled protocol string or just a protocol libcurl has no code for."
msgstr "I-URL oyidlulisele kwi-libcurl isebenzise iprothokholi le libcurl ingayixhasiyo. Inkxaso isenokuba lukhetho lwexesha lokuhlanganiswa ongazange ulusebenzise, inokuba ngumtya weprothokholi opelwe kakubi okanye iprothokholi i-libcurl engenakhowudi yayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Early initialization code failed. This is likely to be an internal error or problem, or a resource problem where something fundamental could not get done at init time."
msgstr "Ikhowudi yokuqalisa kwangoko ayiphumelelanga. Oku kusenokuba yimpazamo yangaphakathi okanye ingxaki, okanye ingxaki yezibonelelo apho into esisiseko ingakwazanga ukwenziwa ngexesha lokuqalisa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL was not properly formatted."
msgstr "I-URL ayibhalwanga ngendlela efanelekileyo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A requested feature, protocol or option was not found built-in in this libcurl due to a build-time decision. This means that a feature or option was not enabled or explicitly disabled when libcurl was built and in order to get it to function you have to get a rebuilt libcurl."
msgstr "Into eceliweyo, iprothokholi okanye ukhetho alufumanekanga lwakhelwe kule libcurl ngenxa yesigqibo sexesha lokwakha. Oku kuthetha ukuba loo nto okanye ukhetho belungavulwanga okanye belicinywe ngokucacileyo xa i-libcurl yayisakhiwa kwaye ukuze isebenze kufuneka ufumane i-libcurl eyakhiwe ngokutsha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve proxy. The given proxy host could not be resolved."
msgstr "Ayikwazanga ukusombulula iproksi. Ihosti yeproksi enikiweyo ayikwazanga ukusombululwa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve host. The given remote host was not resolved."
msgstr "Ayikwazanga ukusombulula ihosti. Ihosti ekude enikiweyo ayisombululwanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to connect() to host or proxy."
msgstr "Kusilele uku-connect() kwihosti okanye kwiproksi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server sent data libcurl could not parse. This error code was known as CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY before 7.51.0."
msgstr "Iseva ithumele idatha i-libcurl engakwazanga ukuyihlalutya. Le khowudi yempazamo ibisaziwa njenge-CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY phambi kwe-7.51.0."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "We were denied access to the resource given in the URL. For FTP, this occurs while trying to change to the remote directory."
msgstr "Saliwe ukufikelela kwisibonelelo esinikwe kwi-URL. Kwi-FTP, oku kwenzeka xa uzama ukutshintshela kulawulo olukude."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "While waiting for the server to connect back when an active FTP session is used, an error code was sent over the control connection or similar."
msgstr "Ngelixa ilinde iseva ukuba iqhagamshele kwakhona xa kusetyenziswa iseshoni esebenzayo ye-FTP, ikhowudi yempazamo ithunyelwe ngoqhagamshelwano lolawulo okanye okufanayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "After having sent the FTP password to the server, libcurl expects a proper reply. This error code indicates that an unexpected code was returned."
msgstr "Emva kokuthumela iphasiwedi ye-FTP kwiserver, i-libcurl ilindele impendulo efanelekileyo. Le khowudi yempazamo ibonisa ukuba kubuyiswe ikhowudi engalindelekanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "During an active FTP session while waiting for the server to connect, the CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (or the internal default) timeout expired."
msgstr "Ngethuba leseshoni ye-FTP esebenzayo ngelixa kulindwe iseva ukuba iqhagamshele, ixesha lokulinda le-CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (okanye elisisiseko sangaphakathi) liphelelwe lixesha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Libcurl failed to get a sensible result back from the server as a response to either a PASV or a EPSV command. The server is flawed."
msgstr "I-Libcurl ayiphumelelanga ukufumana isiphumo esifanelekileyo kwakhona kweseva njengempendulo kumyalelo we-PASV okanye we-EPSV. Iseva inesiphene."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "FTP servers return a 227-line as a response to a PASV command. If libcurl fails to parse that line, this return code is passed back."
msgstr "Iiseva ze-FTP zibuyisela umgca wama-227 njengempendulo kumyalelo we-PASV. Ukuba i-libcurl iyasilela ukuhlalutya loo mgca, le khowudi yembuyekezo ibuyiselwa emva."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal failure to lookup the host used for the new connection."
msgstr "Ukungaphumeleli kwangaphakathi ekukhangeleni ihosti esetyenziselwa uqhagamshelwano olutsha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP2 framing layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Kufunyenwe ingxaki kwicandelo lesakhelo se-HTTP2. Oku kuqhelekile kwaye kunokuba yenye yeengxaki ezininzi, jonga i-buffer yeempazamo ukufumana iinkcukacha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Received an error when trying to set the transfer mode to binary or ASCII."
msgstr "Kufunyenwe impazamo xa bekuzanywa ukuseta imo yokudlulisela kwibhayinari okanye kwi-ASCII."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file transfer was shorter or larger than expected. This happens when the server first reports an expected transfer size, and then delivers data that does not match the previously given size."
msgstr "Uthumelo lwefayile belulufutshane okanye lulukhulu kunoko bekulindelwe. Oku kwenzeka xa iseva iqala ukuxela ubungakanani bothumelo obulindelweyo, emva koko ithumele idatha engahambelaniyo nobungakanani obunikiweyo ngaphambili."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This was either a weird reply to a 'RETR' command or a zero byte transfer complete."
msgstr "Le ibiyimpendulo engaqhelekanga kumyalelo we-'RETR' okanye ukugqitywa kokuthunyelwa kwe-byte enguziro."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Obsolete Error"
msgstr "Impazamo Ephelelwe Lixesha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Not used in modern versions."
msgstr "Ayisetyenziswa kwiinguqulelo zale mihla."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When sending custom \"QUOTE\" commands to the remote server, one of the commands returned an error code that was 400 or higher (for FTP) or otherwise indicated unsuccessful completion of the command."
msgstr "Xa uthumela imiyalelo yesiqhelo ye-\"QUOTE\" kwiseva ekude, omnye wemiyalelo ubuyise ikhowudi yempazamo eyayi-400 okanye ngaphezulu (kwi-FTP) okanye ubonise ukungaphumeleli kokugqitywa komyalelo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is returned if CURLOPT_FAILONERROR is set true and the HTTP server returns an error code that is >= 400."
msgstr "Oku kuyabuyiswa ukuba i-CURLOPT_FAILONERROR isetelwe ku-true kwaye iseva ye-HTTP ibuyisa ikhowudi yempazamo >= 400."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An error occurred when writing received data to a local file, or an error was returned to libcurl from a write callback."
msgstr "Kwenzeke impazamo xa bekubhalwa idatha efunyenweyo kwifayile yalapha ekhaya, okanye impazamo ibuyiselwe kwi-libcurl ukusuka kwi-callback yokubhala."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed starting the upload. For FTP, the server typically denied the STOR command. The error buffer usually contains the server's explanation for this."
msgstr "Kusilele ukuqalisa ukulayisha phezulu. Kwi-FTP, iseva ngokuqhelekileyo iwukhanyele umyalelo we-STOR. Isigcini sempazamo ngokuqhelekileyo siqulethe ingcaciso yeseva ngale nto."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "There was a problem reading a local file or an error returned by the read callback."
msgstr "Kubekho ingxaki ekufundeni ifayile yasekuhlaleni okanye impazamo ebuyiswe yi-callback yokufunda."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A memory allocation request failed. This is serious badness and things are severely screwed up if this ever occurs."
msgstr "Isicelo sokwaba imemori sisilele. Oku yingxaki enzulu kakhulu kwaye izinto zonakele kakhulu ukuba oku kuyakhe kwenzeke."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Operation timeout. The specified time-out period was reached according to the conditions."
msgstr "Ixesha lomsebenzi liphelile. Ixesha elimisiweyo lokuphela lifikelelwe ngokweemeko."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP PORT command returned error. This mostly happens when you have not specified a good enough address for libcurl to use. See CURLOPT_FTPPORT."
msgstr "Umyalelo we-FTP PORT ubuyisele impazamo. Oku kudla ngokwenzeka xa ungachazanga idilesi efanelekileyo eya kusetyenziswa yi-libcurl. Jonga i-CURLOPT_FTPPORT."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP REST command returned error. This should never happen if the server is sane."
msgstr "Umyalelo we-FTP REST ubuyisele impazamo. Oku akufanelanga kwenzeke ukuba iseva isebenza kakuhle."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server does not support or accept range requests."
msgstr "Iseva ayixhasi okanye ayamkeli izicelo zoluhlu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is an odd error that mainly occurs due to internal confusion."
msgstr "Le yimpazamo engaqhelekanga eyenzeka ikakhulu ngenxa yokudideka kwangaphakathi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem occurred somewhere in the SSL/TLS handshake. You really want the error buffer and read the message there as it pinpoints the problem slightly more. Could be certificates (file formats, paths, permissions), passwords, and others."
msgstr "Kwenzeke ingxaki ndawo ithile kwi-handshake ye-SSL/TLS. Ufuna i-buffer yeempazamo kwaye ufunde umyalezo apho njengoko uchaza ingxaki ngokucace gca. Inokuba zizatifiketi (iifomathi zeefayile, imendo, iimvume), iiphasiwedi, kunye nezinye."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The download could not be resumed because the specified offset was out of the file boundary."
msgstr "Ukhuphelo alukwazanga ukuqaliswa kwakhona kuba i-offset echaziweyo ibingaphandle komda wefayili."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file given with FILE:// could not be opened. Most likely because the file path does not identify an existing file. Did you check file permissions?"
msgstr "Ifayile enikwe nge-FILE:// ayikwazanga ukuvulwa. Kusenokwenzeka ukuba umendo wefayile awuchongi ifayile ekhoyo. Ingaba uzijongile iimvume zefayile?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP cannot bind. LDAP bind operation failed."
msgstr "I-LDAP ayikwazi ukubopha. Umsebenzi wokubopha we-LDAP awuphumelelanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search failed."
msgstr "Ukukhangela kwe-LDAP akuphumelelanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Function not found. A required zlib function was not found."
msgstr "Umsebenzi awufunyenwanga. Umsebenzi ofunekayo we-zlib awufunyenwanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Aborted by callback. A callback returned \"abort\" to libcurl."
msgstr "Kuyekisiwe yi-callback. I-callback ibuyisele u-\"abort\" kwi-libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A function was called with a bad parameter."
msgstr "Umsebenzi ubizwe ngepharamitha engalunganga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Interface error. A specified outgoing interface could not be used. Set which interface to use for outgoing connections' source IP address with URLOPT_INTERFACE."
msgstr "Impazamo yojongano. Ujongano oluphumayo oluchaziweyo alukwazanga ukusetyenziswa. Cwangcisa ukuba loluphi ujongano oluza kusetyenziswa kwidilesi ye-IP yomthombo wonxibelelwano oluphumayo usebenzisa URLOPT_INTERFACE."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Too many redirects. When following redirects, libcurl hit the maximum amount. Set your limit with CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."
msgstr "Ukuthunyelwa kwenye indawo okuninzi kakhulu. Xa ilandela ukuthunyelwa kwenye indawo, i-libcurl ifikelele kwelona nani liphezulu. Seta umda wakho nge-CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed to libcurl is not recognized/known. Refer to the appropriate documentation. This is most likely a problem in the program that uses libcurl. The error buffer might contain more specific information about which exact option it concerns."
msgstr "Ukhetho oludluliselwe kwi-libcurl alwaziwa/aluqondwa. Jonga amaxwebhu afanelekileyo. Oku kunokuba yingxaki kwinkqubo esebenzisa i-libcurl. I-buffer yempazamo inokuba neenkcukacha ezithe ngqo malunga nokuba loluphi ukhetho oluchaphazelekayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed in to a setopt was wrongly formatted. See error message for details about what option."
msgstr "Ukhetho oludluliselwe kwi-setopt belufomatwe ngendlela engalunganga. Jonga umyalezo wempazamo ukufumana iinkcukacha malunga nokhetho olo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Nothing was returned from the server, and under the circumstances, getting nothing is considered an error."
msgstr "Akukho nto ibuyiswe kwiseva, kwaye phantsi kwezi meko, ukungafumani nto kuthathwa njengempazamo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The specified crypto engine was not found."
msgstr "Injini yokufihla echaziweyo ayifunyenwanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed setting the selected SSL crypto engine as default."
msgstr "Kusilele ukuseta injini yokufihla ye-SSL ekhethiweyo njengesisiseko."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed sending network data."
msgstr "Kusilele ukuthumela idatha yothungelwano."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failure with receiving network data."
msgstr "Ukusilela ekufumaneni idatha yothungelwano."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "problem with the local client certificate."
msgstr "ingxaki ngesatifikethi somxhasi sasekuhlaleni."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not use specified cipher."
msgstr "Ayikwazanga ukusebenzisa i-cipher echaziweyo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server's SSL certificate or SSH fingerprint was deemed not OK. This error code has been unified with CURLE_SSL_CACERT since 7.62.0. Its previous value was 51."
msgstr "Isatifikethi se-SSL seseva ekude okanye i-fingerprint ye-SSH ibonwe njengengalunganga. Le khowudi yempazamo idityaniswe ne-CURLE_SSL_CACERT ukususela kwi-7.62.0. Ixabiso layo langaphambili belingama-51."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unrecognized transfer encoding."
msgstr "Ukukhowuda kokuthumela okungaqondwayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum file size exceeded."
msgstr "Owona mlinganiselo uphezulu wefayile ugqithisiwe."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requested FTP SSL level failed."
msgstr "Inqanaba le-FTP SSL eliceliweyo aliphumelelanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When doing a send operation curl had to rewind the data to retransmit, but the rewinding operation failed."
msgstr "Xa isenza umsebenzi wokuthumela i-curl kuye kwafuneka ibuyisele idatha umva ukuze iyithumele kwakhona, kodwa ukubuyisela umva akuphumelelanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Initiating the SSL Engine failed."
msgstr "Ukuqalisa i-SSL Engine kusilele."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server denied curl to login (Added in 7.13.1)"
msgstr "Iseva ekude ayiyivumelanga i-curl ukuba ingene (Yongezwe kwi-7.13.1)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File not found on TFTP server."
msgstr "Ifayile ayifunyenwanga kwiseva ye-TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Permission problem on TFTP server."
msgstr "Ingxaki yemvume kwiseva ye-TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Out of disk space on the server."
msgstr "Kuphele indawo kwidiski kwiseva."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Illegal TFTP operation."
msgstr "Umsebenzi we-TFTP ongavumelekanga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unknown TFTP transfer ID."
msgstr "I-ID yotshintsho lwe-TFTP engaziwayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File already exists and is not overwritten."
msgstr "Ifayile sele ikhona kwaye ayibhalwa ngaphezulu."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This error should never be returned by a properly functioning TFTP server."
msgstr "Le mpazamo ayifanele ibuyiswe yiseva ye-TFTP esebenza kakuhle."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Problem with reading the SSL CA cert (path? access rights?)"
msgstr "Ingxaki ekufundeni isatifikethi se-SSL CA (umendo? amalungelo okufikelela?)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The resource referenced in the URL does not exist."
msgstr "Umthombo obhekiswe kuwo kwi-URL awukho."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An unspecified error occurred during the SSH session."
msgstr "Kwenzeke impazamo engachazwanga ngexesha leseshoni ye-SSH."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to shut down the SSL connection."
msgstr "Kusilele ukuvala uqhagamshelwano lwe-SSL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Socket is not ready for send/recv wait till it's ready and try again. This return code is only returned from curl_easy_recv and curl_easy_send (Added in 7.18.2)"
msgstr "I-Socket ayikakulungeli ukuthumela/ukufumana, linda ide ilunge uze uzame kwakhona. Le khowudi ibuyiswa kuphela yi-curl_easy_recv kunye ne-curl_easy_send (Yongezwe kwi-7.18.2)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to load CRL file (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Kusilele ukulayisha ifayile ye-CRL (Yongezwe kwi-7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Issuer check failed (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Ukuhlolwa komkhuphi akuphumelelanga (Yongezwe kwi-7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP server does not understand the PRET command at all or does not support the given argument. Be careful when using CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a custom LIST command is sent with the PRET command before PASV as well. (Added in 7.20.0)"
msgstr "Iseva ye-FTP ayiwuqondi kwaphela umyalelo we-PRET okanye ayiyixhasi ingxoxo enikiweyo. Lumka xa usebenzisa i-CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, umyalelo owenziwe ngokwezifiso we-LIST uthunyelwa kunye nomyalelo we-PRET phambi kwe-PASV kwakhona. (Yongezwe ku-7.20.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP CSeq numbers."
msgstr "Ukungangqinelani kwamanani e-RTSP CSeq."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP Session Identifiers."
msgstr "Ukungangqinelani kwezazisi zeSeshoni ye-RTSP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unable to parse FTP file list (during FTP wildcard downloading)."
msgstr "Ayikwazi ukuhlalutya uluhlu lweefayile ze-FTP (ngexesha lokukhuphela nge-wildcard ye-FTP)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Chunk callback reported error."
msgstr "Umbuyiselo wecandelo uxele impazamo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "(For internal use only, is never returned by libcurl) No connection available, the session is queued. (added in 7.30.0)"
msgstr "(Yokusetyenziswa ngaphakathi kuphela, ayibuyiselwa yi-libcurl) Akukho qhagamshelwano lufumanekayo, iseshoni ifakwe emgceni. (yongezwe kwi-7.30.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to match the pinned key specified with CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."
msgstr "Kusilele ukuhambelana nesitshixo esibethelelweyo esixelwe nge-CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Status returned failure when asked with CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."
msgstr "Ubume bubuyisele ukusilela xa bubuziwe nge-CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stream error in the HTTP/2 framing layer."
msgstr "Impazamo yomsinga kwileyari yesakhelo ye-HTTP/2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An API function was called from inside a callback."
msgstr "Umsebenzi we-API ubizwe ngaphakathi kwi-callback."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An authentication function returned an error."
msgstr "Umsebenzi wokuqinisekisa ubuyise impazamo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP/3 layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Kufunyenwe ingxaki kwicandelo le-HTTP/3. Oku kuqhelekile kwaye kunokuba yenye yeengxaki ezininzi, jonga i-buffer yeempazamo ukufumana iinkcukacha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "QUIC connection error. This error may be caused by an SSL library error. QUIC is the protocol used for HTTP/3 transfers."
msgstr "Impazamo yoqhagamshelo lwe-QUIC. Le mpazamo ingabangelwa yimpazamo yelayibrari ye-SSL. I-QUIC yiprothokholi esetyenziselwa utshintshelo lwe-HTTP/3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy handshake error. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR provides extra details on the specific problem."
msgstr "Impazamo yokuxhawulana kwe-Proxy. I-CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR ibonelela ngeenkcukacha ezongezelelweyo malunga nengxaki ethile."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSL Client Certificate required."
msgstr "Isatifikethi soMxhasi se-SSL siyafuneka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal call to poll() or select() returned error that is not recoverable."
msgstr "Ubizo lwangaphakathi ku-poll() okanye u-select() lubuyise impazamo engenakulungiseka."

